OL,3,GNEWSAKettering art gallery reopens
OL,4,Aafter six years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gallery has welcomed visitors for the
OL,7,Ffirst time in six years following
OL,8,Frenovation work.
OL,10,FAlfred East Art Gallery in Kettering,
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire, has reopened with
OL,12,FFaces and Places, an exhibition
OL,13,Ffeaturing landscapes, portraits and
OL,14,Fscenes by local artists.
OL,16,FThe gallery initially closed during the
OL,17,FCovid pandemic, with its reopening
OL,18,Fdelayed by extensive building work and
OL,19,Froof repairs following rain damage in
OL,20,F2023.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
